    "cslM": 0
   }
  ],
  "legend": [],
  "notes": [
   {
    "no": "1",
    "text": "TO OPERATE SIDING POINT KEY \u2018R IS REQUIRED TO BE INSERTED IN KLR2"
   },
   {
    "no": "2",
    "text": "KEY \u2018R CAN BE EXTRACTED FROM KLR1 ONLY WHEN S.M. EXTENDS PERMISSION FROM S.M's VDU EXTRACTION OF KEY \u2018R FROM KLR1 WILL BLOCK ALL SIGNALLED MOVEMENT OVER SIDING POINT 51A/B"
   },
   {
    "no": "3",
    "text": "KEY \u2018R WHEN INSERTED IN KLR2 POINT FREE INDICATION APPEARS ON THE BOARD POINT BUTTON & NORMAL OR REVERSE BUTTONS ARE SIMULTANEOUSLY PRESSED TO SET THE POINT TO NORMAL OR REVERSE AS THE CASE MAY BE."
   },
   {
    "no": "4",
    "text": "AFTER THE SETTING OF POINT TO REVERSE, KEY \u2018R SHOULD BE EXTRACTED FROM KLR2 AND KEPT IN THE CUSTODY OF THE SHUNTING PORTER REMOVAL OF KEY\u2019R WILL LOCK THE POINT"
   },
   {
    "no": "5",
    "text": "AFTER COMPLETION OF THE MOVEMENT KEY \u2018R IS TO BE INSERTED IN KLR2 & SIDING POINT 51A/B IS TO BE OPERATED TO NORMAL. AFTER ENSURING BOTH END OF CONTROL PT 51A/B IN NORMAL SETTING KEY 'R IS EXTRACTED FROM KLR2 & INSERTED IN KLR1 TO ENABLE SM TO RELEASE THE CONTROL 51."
   },
   {
    "no": "6",
    "text": "KEY \u2018R IN KLR1 RESUMES SIGNALLING MOVEMENT OVER 51A/B IN NORMAL POSITION."
   },
   {
    "no": "7",
    "text": "CRANK HANDLE, CH51 IS TO BE TAKEN OUT FOR CRANK HANDLING THE POINT 51A/B IN CASE OF FAILURE OF ELECTRICAL OPERATION."
   },
   {
    "no": "5",
    "text": "ALL SIGNALS ARE PROVIDED WITH LED LAMP"
   },
   {
    "no": "6",
    "text": "MAIN VDU ALONG WITH STAND BY IS PROVIDED FOR OPERATION OF ALL SIGNALLING GEARS WITH FULL DESCRIPTION OF THE YARD"
   },
   {
    "no": "7",
    "text": "\u2018NO LIGHT PROTECTION\u2019 IS PROVIDED FOR ALL STOP & SHUNT SIGNALS"
   },
   {
    "no": "8",
    "text": "SIZE OF DUAL VDU 65 /4K"
   },
   {
    "no": "10",
    "text": "SIGNALLING ARRANGMENT IS PROVIDED TO SUIT 25KV AC SYSTEM."
   },
   {
    "no": "11",
    "text": "BEFORE PERMITTING NON SIGNAL/CALLING ON SIGNAL MOVEMENT CLEARANCE OF THE TRACK ON THE ROUTE INCLUDING FOULING TRACK (IF ANY) SHOWING \u2018RED SHALL BE PHYSICALLY VERIFIED BY ON DUTY SM. THIS IS TO BE INCORPORATED IN THE SWR"
   },
   {
    "no": "12",
    "text": "BEFORE TAKING OFF CALLING ON SIGNAL, ON DUTY SM SHALL ENSURE THAT THE TRAIN HAS COME TO STILL STAND AT THE FOOT OF THE SIGNAL. NO RUN THROUGH IS PERMITTED"
   },
   {
    "no": "13",
    "text": "\u2018HARD KEY SHALL BE PROVIDED TO STATION MASTERS FOR OPERATION OF VDU AND SAME TO BE MENTIONED IN SWR"
   },
   {
    "no": "16",
    "text": "STAGGERING BETWEEN DETECTION POINT OF DAC(STANDBY) IS PROVIDED 1.5 TO 1.8m"
   },
   {
    "no": "17",
    "text": "APPROXIMATE NO OF ROUTES IS 32"
   },
   {
    "no": "19",
    "text": "AUTOMATIC MEDIA CHANGEOVER IS PROVIDED FOR BLOCK PANEL UFSBI."
   },
   {
    "no": "20",
    "text": "THE PROPOSED LOCATIONS OF SIGNALS ARE TO BE VERIFIED WITH RESPECT TO THE REPORT OF SIGNAL SIGHTING COMMITTEE?? AND LOCATION OF ??NEUTRAL SECTION?? BEFORE EXECUTION OF WORKS & COMMISSIONING OF THE SECTION."
   },
   {
    "no": "21",
    "text": "AS PER RAILWAY BOARD LETTER NO 2021/S g/25"
   },
   {
    "no": "22",
    "text": "AS PER RAILWAY BOARD LETTER NO 2024/S g/18/1/S gDATE(efile 3460118). DATED:08.04 2025 FOR STATIONS UP TO 100 ROUTES RCC WILL BE GENERATED USING S gDATE. FOR STANDERDIZATION OF S&T DRAWINGS RCC INTERFACE CIRCUIT APPLICATION LOGIC & EQUIVALENT CIRCUIT TO BE ADOPTED AS PER APPROVED STANDARD TYPICAL CIRCUIT OF EI BY RDSO"
   },
   {
    "no": "23",
    "text": "TRACK CIRCUIT NO MLT1 AND LLT1 ARE PROVIDED WITH QBAT RELAYS"
  },
  {
   "no": "27",
   "text": "SIGNAL NO. S/C01A/B, S28, S/C04 & S/C06 TO BE MADE DEFUNCT TILL COMMISSIONING OF NEW RAILWAY LINE BETWEEN ARMORI-GADCHIROLI."
  },
  {
   "no": "28",
   "text": "THE ABOVE MENTIONED SIGNALLING MOVEMENTS ARE DISABLED FROM EI SYSTEM."
  },
  {
   "no": "29",
   "text": "LED ASPECT SIGNAL OTHER THAN RED ASPECT LED OF SIGNAL NO. S/C01A/B & S28."
   }
  ],
